PASS  equal-norm perturbations differ markedly in effect   | max/min damage = 3.8x at identical ||dW||_F (random directions; the paper's STRUCTURED Schur ablations separate far more, see eq. 8)
PASS  so ||dW|| alone cannot rank a weight change   | which is exactly why the paper needs a coordinate system
